  "note": "Election of the Ballyclare Urban Council, polled Wednesday 18 May 1955 (Belfast News-Letter, 19 May 1955, p. 8). Sixteen candidates for nine seats; poll 72 per cent. There was a tie for last place between J. E. Bingham and W. Holmes, and Holmes lost on the toss of a coin. Citation unconfirmed: the names were not all found on the cited page (verification 5 Nov 2026)."
